| Function | Returned Output | New Personal Best? |
|:--|--:|:--|
| **1** | 0.000000 | No |
| **2** | -0.082041 | No |
| **3** | -0.020167 | **Yes** |
| **4** | -0.300645 | **Yes** |
| **5** | 2329.015850 | **Yes** |
| **6** | -2.661556 | No |
